It imitates attacks but it still dies like a chameleon.  If you manage
to survive the first hit by what looks like a minotaur there's an okay
chance that you can popcorn kill the chameleon with one hit of your
best weapon.

If it is a real minotaur because of a polymorph trap, it will hit like
a minotaur but also die like a minotaur (hard to kill compared to
XP levels in the mines).

This is a very good reason to zap, cast, fire and throw at any
advancing monster that looks mean.  If it is a chameleon you may
be able to kill it before it gets int he first hit.  If it is a real
minotaur,
at least you have been doing some amount of damage before it
reaches you so you have some chance to killing it before it
popcorn kills you.



